      "sha256": "9248518575a4a800b3622e903b9dc7880fada421cebd702f1c886c5ffad4f735",
      "duration": 1.300317
    },
    "P5.11k": {
      "file": "assets/audio/P5.11k.mp3",
      "text": "thirty pixels.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "2bd15122b3bc7363b652dc18b765af2dd5564d1494723cd6b038a82886f3fcaa",
      "duration": 1.718277
    },
    "D.1": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.1.mp3",
      "text": "Ana, do you have a minute? There’s a bug before the launch. The “Buy now” button doesn’t show on mobile.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "ff92de68cbd913cfda5a53bb1006a6a0ca60a490450099b1a5222a612245b126",
      "duration": 7.523265
    },
    "D.2": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.2.mp3",
      "text": "Oh no! On which phones?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "493915b0f05ef24c7275ec59fff1d2eb071775a1f611b564b75719644af0a355",
      "duration": 1.904036
    },
    "D.3": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.3.mp3",
      "text": "On small screens. When the pop-up opens, it covers the button. I’ve tested it on three phones, and it breaks on all of them.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "725595e15fa249ea5863887a5c7d362f2237921204e62b922e38e5e6c5227987",
      "duration": 9.287982
    },
    "D.4": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.4.mp3",
      "text": "Hmm. What if we move the button above the pictures?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "d0417262768595bcbdf1f3f1d6a35bece3227d72f665568d7297c8aaec989e1f",
      "duration": 3.390113
    },
    "D.5": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.5.mp3",
      "text": "Good idea, but the design will change. Could you check it today? The launch is on Friday.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "f3888da41d1045a25c35cd597eae2b7732295bacaf407e1f85fa78f5914bb90b",
      "duration": 6.687347
    },
    "D.6": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.6.mp3",
      "text": "Sure. I’ll send you a new version this afternoon. Have you talked to Leo?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "d89df18a9e6d39e0bd3cad5473ef46f12eabd81dff64c11223ab417923ef8818",
      "duration": 4.504671
    },
    "D.7": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.7.mp3",
      "text": "Not yet. I’ve written to him, but he hasn’t answered yet. He’s in a meeting.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "1814fb4b5f2394d94ce6365ed644b13a2fe7d41b989437ace1e7a72a105c77a9",
      "duration": 5.433469
    },
    "D.8": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.8.mp3",
      "text": "OK. And what about the screen reader? Last week, it didn’t read the button.",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "02e65b0c367c75b445a7877aa1b730f1bab7dbb423473457621878205433e96e",
      "duration": 5.712109
    },
    "D.9": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.9.mp3",
      "text": "I’ve already fixed that. Now it reads “Buy now”. I tested it yesterday with my eyes closed!",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "4adbb6bb5f5f28ab78cda8d0d535e62e8b0d70d69b5cb82034ef1415fa8f7dde",
      "duration": 8.266304
    },
    "D.10": {
      "file": "assets/audio/D.10.mp3",
      "text": "Ha! Perfect. Let’s fix the mobile version, and then we can deploy.",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "165920b9aa0d0695e0131ab0b5ef69b0eba8d4ec8dcada8682c1a6cf86ebb266",
      "duration": 4.551111
    },
    "G.0": {
      "file": "assets/audio/G.0.mp3",
      "text": "I’ve fixed the menu. I’ve tested it on three phones.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "e77697cfdea0db89583e7bb318bf8b1baceb2d5e28ee7e6b3357d0aa8d891e2f",
      "duration": 4.365351
    },
    "G.1": {
      "file": "assets/audio/G.1.mp3",
      "text": "I haven’t deployed it yet.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "ca78988712fe6d6762174119f2028f8c55c711dc90341b1492ea540cc5661404",
      "duration": 1.811156
    },
    "G.2": {
      "file": "assets/audio/G.2.mp3",
      "text": "I’ve worked with React for two years. I’ve worked here since 2024.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "cb197d2e3d45a948faad2f460616b5a87988f2a1b6ae28e511fdbd58eaccef57",
      "duration": 5.804989
    },
    "G.3": {
      "file": "assets/audio/G.3.mp3",
      "text": "I built a shop page last year. I fixed it yesterday.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "1295b30399c50aa41798d12a5645afadcf4c825d89f97f7b0eb0c0fed3aeceeb",
      "duration": 3.947392
    },
    "Y8.1": {
      "file": "assets/audio/Y8.1.mp3",
      "text": "Hi! What are you working on today?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "9f5e7eae1b75097a77157d2479b490132c1a54d9a8c9b95fe769ed6c7c05fa8c",
      "duration": 2.089796
    },
    "Y8.3": {
      "file": "assets/audio/Y8.3.mp3",
      "text": "Nice. Any problems?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "e0a611c1202a0bf5cd0c2941110e23657de029e98d7a5434aa3d6c6e5a34f8f3",
      "duration": 1.578957
    },
    "Y8.5": {
      "file": "assets/audio/Y8.5.mp3",
      "text": "Oh no! What have you done?",
      "speaker": "ana",
      "voiceId": "cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9",
      "sha256": "b1c59853f169213d3d04b326791f9c6327a3ce2a6484d01466d32f00bb24b8e0",
      "duration": 1.671837
    },
    "L.9": {
      "file": "assets/audio/L.9.mp3",
      "text": "Hi, Kim! It’s Leo. Thanks for your message. I’ve looked at the new version on my phone, and it looks great. Just one thing before we deploy: the “Buy now” button is too small on mobile. Could you make it bigger? Forty-four pixels, at least. And please don’t deploy today. The tests haven’t finished yet. Let’s deploy tomorrow morning, at ten. Thanks!",
      "speaker": "leo",
      "voiceId": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B",
      "sha256": "f007db91c3ad1d30e893094d0bbedc061c8ec2524f5b6fc1ecdd0d0848b3f028",
      "duration": 24.938231
    },
    "X.1": {
      "file": "assets/audio/X.1.mp3",
      "text": "I’ve worked with React since 2023.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "d34694faa5f9683a66b2e7363f5c1f52de4cddd29d03f6f070cfe8e95d3cb7de",
      "duration": 3.390113
    },
    "X.2": {
      "file": "assets/audio/X.2.mp3",
      "text": "I fixed the bug yesterday.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "f356e1a197889f03a596b1be88b4e56159fc6f3f457e7ea51d44ff7a01d270ff",
      "duration": 2.043356
    },
    "X.3": {
      "file": "assets/audio/X.3.mp3",
      "text": "I haven’t deployed it yet.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "ca78988712fe6d6762174119f2028f8c55c711dc90341b1492ea540cc5661404",
      "duration": 1.811156
    },
    "X.4": {
      "file": "assets/audio/X.4.mp3",
      "text": "Could you check the form?",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "77341ec2584e70b5287dcce0f6a297a2666eb26e68d5815f41fd35ef8e385ea8",
      "duration": 1.671837
    },
    "X.5": {
      "file": "assets/audio/X.5.mp3",
      "text": "Tomorrow, we’ll run the tests.",
      "speaker": "kim",
      "voiceId": "Nhs7eitvQWFTQBsf0yiT",
      "sha256": "2a0dcd98e943a32a5666f5f2ddc2d2fbbeb5d5ca833748673a6496b9e75e3f5a",
      "duration": 2.089796
    },
    "J.1": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.1.mp3",
      "text": "Hi, thanks for joining! Can you hear me OK? Great. So, tell me a little about yourself.",
      "speaker": "jun",
      "voiceId": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX",
      "sha256": "77a67a70f22cb183ed8707433b0c60c43eb5b55309d5bbf19266a27a0be1da0a",
      "duration": 5.897868
    },
    "J.2": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.2.mp3",
      "text": "What have you built? Tell me about a project you’re proud of.",
      "speaker": "jun",
      "voiceId": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX",
      "sha256": "4453a183769b50e17875b95f2cc71473bc829d484b1637079d69ab3f8976a3bf",
      "duration": 3.622313
    },
    "J.3": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.3.mp3",
      "text": "Interesting! What was the hardest part?",
      "speaker": "jun",
      "voiceId": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX",
      "sha256": "aac8e0fc373bfaadb142ea5a6c4769622fb92c8dd7cfeaf282aa9ace0d1a0713",
      "duration": 2.693515
    },
    "J.4": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.4.mp3",
      "text": "A lot of our users are on their phones. How do you make a page work on mobile?",
      "speaker": "jun",
      "voiceId": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX",
      "sha256": "5d112e6a45e87b6d74a08e997cfd9211d968ce828cef93e97e4008f1f451d1df",
      "duration": 4.690431
    },
    "J.5": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.5.mp3",
      "text": "And how do you make a page accessible? For example, for people who use a screen reader.",
      "speaker": "jun",
      "voiceId": "XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX",
      "sha256": "809bd2f356c84f09eb1cdcfd07b9e729bfd4dc2f5eb0d9ad35b3c9760238349a",
      "duration": 5.10839
    },
    "J.6": {
      "file": "assets/audio/J.6.mp3",
